        "summary": "Dc χMT decreases from 57.26 cm3 K mol-1 at 300 K to a minimum of 42.04 cm3 K mol-1 near 5 K then rises slightly to 42.65 cm3 K mol-1 at 2 K, suggesting weak intramolecular ferromagnetic Dy···Dy interactions superimposed on Stark depopulation. Magnetization is unsaturated and M vs H/T curves do not superimpose, indicating anisotropy and/or low-lying excited states. No out-of-phase ac signal in zero dc field; a field-induced slow-relaxation response appears, with an optimal dc field of 1200 Oe producing two relaxation phases (fast and slow).",
